  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When I processed the first figure using UdonGraph,  only the processing of the \"False\" part worked, and the processing of the \"True\" part was not performed.\nThis means that only newly owner players will not be processed for the OnOwnershipTransferred event.\nThis is what I found out by my own research, but when I run the OnOwnershipTransferred event, only the new owner will get the red line log on the second image.\nI suspect this is probably related to this bug.\nI'd be happy if you could fix it.\nDiscord conversation history:\nhttps://discord.com/channels/189511567539306508/821518817887780874/821763969365835887",
